## 6. ApplicationService 역싱크 호출 위치

### 6.1 기존 흐름

```
ProductDynamicIndexListener.onMessage()
  └─> ProductIndexApplicationService.indexProducts()
        └─> ProductMergeStrategy.merge()
        └─> ProductAssembleService.assemble()
        └─> ProductEvaluator.evaluate()
        └─> ProductIndexRepository.bulk()  // ES 색인
